are also available through TIAA/CREF . Paid Time Off: Full time exempt employees accrue 14.66 hours of annual leave and 14 hours of medical leave per month. Employee Educational Assistance Plan Eastern New Mexico University offers a tuition waiver for regular employees and retirees. This program waives the tuition for three courses (up to nine credit hours) per semester. Employees' spouses or children may be eligible to use the tuition waiver during any semester that it is not being used by the employee. 01 How did you hear about this employment opportunity? Albuquerque Journal Amarillo Globe News Chronicle of Higher Education Clovis News Journal ENMU Website Lubbock Avalanche Portales News Tribune Ruidoso News Roswell Daily Records Alamogordo Daily News Professional Journal www.enmjobfinder.com www.higheredjobs.com www.monster.com www.Indeed.com www.highplainshelpwanted.com Other Required Question Employer Eastern New Mexico University Address 1500 S. Ave. K, Station 21 Portales, New Mexico, 88130 Phone 575-562-2115 Website http://www.enmu.edu Apply"
