    "https://www.schooljobs.com/careers/enmu/jobs/5485906/accountant": {
      "title": "Accountant",
      "description": "Accountant Salary Depends on Qualifications Location Main Campus - Portales, NM Job Type Full time permanent Job Number 2026-00148 Department Business Affairs Division Business Office Opening Date 09/17/2026 Description Benefits Position Overview Position Summary Under general supervision, perform professional accounting and financial administration functions involving analysis, review, interpretation, and application of university policies, accounting principles, and applicable state and federal regulations. Exercise independent judgment in reviewing financial transactions, resolving accounting issues, and advising university departments on financial matters. Requirements Duties and Responsibilities: Analyze, prepare, and review complex accounting reports, financial transactions, and account reconciliations; identify discrepancies, determine appropriate corrective actions, and resolve accounting issues in accordance with applicable policies, regulations, and accounting principles. Review and approve university expenditures and expenditure requests within established delegated authority; evaluate transactions for compliance with university policies, accounting requirements, funding restrictions, and applicable state and federal regulations, and determine appropriate action when transactions do not comply . Exercise independent judgment in interpreting and applying university accounting policies, procedures, and applicable state and federal requirements; evaluate unusual or complex financial circumstances and determine appropriate accounting or administrative action Advise the University community of the policies and procedures utilized by the Office of Business Affairs and State and Federal regulations Respond to business office inquiries from the University community Assist with the close of the fiscal year Ensure that work assignments are completed timely and accurately Regular and predictable attendance is required Perform related duties as 